  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>In first step of the reaction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;will attack on the lone pairs of electrons of the oxygen atom. Which will get dehydrated forming carbocation intermediate. On this carbocation&nbsp;pi bond will attack forming a five membered cyclic ring. In last step&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Br</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;will combine with carbocation forming final product according to the following reactions.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7ec1e782-39a9-4689-93cb-7268fa53eda7-image.png\" style=\"width: 461px; height: 300px;\" /></p></blockquote>",
